      "source": "A pointcut is composed of a <a href=\"ClassFilter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>ClassFilter</code></a> and a <a href=\"MethodMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>MethodMatcher</code></a>.\nBoth these basic terms and a Pointcut itself can be combined to build up combinations\n(for example, through <a href=\"support/ComposablePointcut.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.support\"><code>ComposablePointcut</code></a>).",
